SUMMARY:Places Known and Remembered: An Art Exhibition by Laura Gatzos
LOCATION:West Roxbury Library
DESCRIPTION:through Jan 2\nThis exhibit by Laura Gatzos\, contains depictio
 ns of familiar and comforting scenes and places we encounter as New Englan
 ders. From local parks to rural roads\, from museums to comforting scenes 
 of home\, the paintings in this collection invoke a sense of nostalgia and
  wonderment and assert that beauty and color are a form of self-care."\nht
 tps://bpl.bibliocommons.com/events/6af1edbc901b02002cc8905b\nFrom Pushpin 
 Boston: https://pushpin.city/
URL:https://bpl.bibliocommons.com/events/6af1edbc901b02002cc8905b
END:VEVENT
