SUMMARY:Chinese Americans in Science & Technology
LOCATION:MIT\, 1 AMHERST ST\, Cambridge\, MA 02142
DESCRIPTION:MIT-China presents the China Diaologue Series. Panelists Profes
 sors Xiaoxing Xi and Gang Chen\, moderated by Professor Yasheng Huang\, wi
 ll explore how professional achievement can intersect with heightened nati
 onal-security considerations. Drawing on personal experiences and institut
 ional perspectives\, the discussion will address evolving policies and the
  broader implications for academia\, scientific research\, and internation
 al collaboration.\nhttps://calendar.mit.edu/event/when-success-meets-suspi
 cion-chinese-americans-in-science-technology\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https:/
 /pushpin.city/
URL:https://calendar.mit.edu/event/when-success-meets-suspicion-chinese-ame
 ricans-in-science-technology
END:VEVENT
