LOCATION:Jamaica Plain Library\, 30 South Street\, Jamaica Plain\, MA 02130
DESCRIPTION:Michelle A. Gabow (playwright and author) will launch her fourt
 h novel\, a simple queer incorrigible heartbreaking miraculous life\, an i
 ntrospective work that exists in the space between fiction\, memoir and pr
 ose poetry\, exploring aging\, grief\, memory and falling in love at any a
 ge.\nhttps://bpl.bibliocommons.com/events/6af88e68e14c170074fef264\nFrom P
 ushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/
