SUMMARY:Author Talk and Reading: Rob Quinn
LOCATION:Hyde Park Library\, 35 Harvard Ave\, Hyde Park\, MA 02136
DESCRIPTION:On the Other Side of the Street is Rob Quinn’s account of liv
 ing through HIV\, serious illness\, addiction\, and the loss of a career a
 nd identity he valued. Through the image of a street crossing\, he explore
 s recognizing change\, accepting support\, and beginning again. Each chapt
 er includes reflection questions and a self-care activity. At the reading\
 , Rob will share passages and invite a community conversation about the cr
 ossings in our own lives.\nhttps://bpl.bibliocommons.com/events/6abbc1e3eb
 ad22004541bd03\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/
URL:https://bpl.bibliocommons.com/events/6abbc1e3ebad22004541bd03
